Cell["\<\
For code consistency we solve the problem using tauMat, though in this case \
tauMat represents the conformation tensor A and should be appropriately \
transformed in the output.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.948490214607997*^9, 
  3.9484902710100603`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"de39a23d-2b2d-4544-8cac-\
